{'symbol': 'HUM', 'date': '2022-02-14 16:30:00', 'title': 'HUMANA SELECTED BY LOUISIANA HEALTH DEPARTMENT TO SERVE MEDICAID BENEFICIARIES', 'text': "BATON ROUGE, LA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LEADING HEALTH INSURER AND HEALTH CARE SERVICES COMPANY HUMANA INC. (NYSE: HUM) HAS BEEN NOTIFIED BY THE LOUISIANA DEPARTMENT OF HEALTH (LDH) THAT THE LDH INTENDS TO AWARD A CONTRACT TO HUMANA TO DELIVER HEALTH CARE COVERAGE TO MEDICAID BENEFICIARIES ACROSS THE STATE. HUMANA'S MEDICAID DIVISION — HUMANA HEALTHY HORIZONS — EXPECTS TO BEGIN ADMINISTERING THE COVERAGE IN LOUISIANA LATER THIS YEAR, PENDING THE STATE'S COMPLETION OF ITS STANDARD PROTEST PERIOD. HUM"}